<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:57:31 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>宇宙已有138亿年的历史。韦伯发现的星系看起来像是在宇宙中静静地形成恒星数十亿年，而在观测时，宇宙的年龄只有几亿年</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-universe-is-13-8-billion-years-old-webb-is-finding-galaxies-that-look-like-theyve-been-quietly-forming-stars-for-billions-of-years-inside-a-cosmos-that-was-at-the-time-of-observation-o</link><description>韦伯令人惊叹的早期星系正迫使天文学家重新思考宇宙历史，但并不完全像头条新闻所暗示的那样。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-universe-is-13-8-billion-years-old-webb-is-finding-galaxies-that-look-like-theyve-been-quietly-forming-stars-for-billions-of-years-inside-a-cosmos-that-was-at-the-time-of-observation-o.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:57:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-universe-is-13-8-billion-years-old-webb-is-finding-galaxies-that-look-like-theyve-been-quietly-forming-stars-for-billions-of-years-inside-a-cosmos-that-was-at-the-time-of-observation-o</guid></item><item><title>PayPal 董事会称 Stripe 和 Advent 的 530 亿美元出价不够充分</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/paypal-board-calls-stripe-and-advents-53bn-bid-inadequate</link><description>支付专家表示，Stripe 与 PayPal 的潜在交易可能会加速数字支付创新，但监管障碍、集成复杂性和估值仍然是最大的障碍。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/paypal-board-calls-stripe-and-advents-53bn-bid-inadequate.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:42:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/paypal-board-calls-stripe-and-advents-53bn-bid-inadequate</guid></item><item><title>据报道，Anthropic 正在洽谈以 60 亿美元收购 Peer Decart，以在 IPO 前增强计算能力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/anthropic-reportedly-in-talks-to-acquire-peer-decart-for-6-billion-bolstering-compute-ahead-of-ipo</link><description>据报道，人工智能初创公司 Anthropic 正在洽谈以约 60 亿美元（约合新台币 1,900 亿元）收购同行 Decart AI。如果最终完成，这笔交易将标志着 Anthropic 历史上最大的收购，而此时该公司正在为备受期待的 IPO 做准备。彭博社于 8 月 13 日首次报道了该交易，并指出该协议尚未最终确定，谈判仍有可能失败。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/anthropic-reportedly-in-talks-to-acquire-peer-decart-for-6-billion-bolstering-compute-ahead-of-ipo.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:27:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/anthropic-reportedly-in-talks-to-acquire-peer-decart-for-6-billion-bolstering-compute-ahead-of-ipo</guid></item><item><title>超过一半的 AI 生成的补丁已损坏</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/more-than-half-of-aigenerated-patches-are-broken</link><description>新的研究表明，像 ChatGPT 和 Claude 这样的人工智能模型经常无法修复网络安全漏洞，反而经常引入新的代码漏洞。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/more-than-half-of-aigenerated-patches-are-broken2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:12:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/more-than-half-of-aigenerated-patches-are-broken</guid></item><item><title>水务行业刚刚敲响了警钟。再次</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-water-sector-just-got-its-wakeup-call-again</link><description>在联邦调查局和美国环保局就七个州的网络攻击发出警报后，自来水公司面临着来自基本的、可预防的安全漏洞的紧急威胁。以下是修复它们的方法。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-water-sector-just-got-its-wakeup-call-again.webp" /&gt; 由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 23:57:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-water-sector-just-got-its-wakeup-call-again</guid></item><item><title>使用狄拉克费米子对单光子进行热探测</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/thermal-detection-of-single-photons-using-dirac-fermions</link><description>单光子探测器对于各种量子和成像应用至关重要。在这里，作者报道了石墨烯测辐射热计能够在高达 1.2 K 的温度下检测单个近红外光子，固有量子效率高达 87%，暗计数 &amp;lt; 1 每秒，有效噪声等效功率低至 2 × 10−22 W/ $$\sqrt{{{{\rm{Hz}}}}}$$ Hz。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/thermal-detection-of-single-photons-using-dirac-fermions.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 23:42:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/thermal-detection-of-single-photons-using-dirac-fermions</guid></item><item><title>区分胶质母细胞瘤的真实进展和治疗效果：多学科团队神经肿瘤学的实用、循证成像框架</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/distinguishing-true-progression-from-treatment-effects-in-glioblastoma-a-practical-evidencegraded-imaging-framework-for-the-multidisciplinary-team-neurooncology</link><description>胶质母细胞瘤 (GBM) 放化疗后区分真进展 (TP) 与治疗效果（假性进展 (PsP) 和放射性坏死 (RN)）是一个重要的、尚未解决的决定，传统 MRI 无法在 30-40% 的病例中可靠地做出决定，而且很少由任何单一专业单独做出。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/distinguishing-true-progression-from-treatment-effects-in-glioblastoma-a-practical-evidencegraded-imaging-framework-for-the-multidisciplinary-team-neurooncology.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 23:27:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/distinguishing-true-progression-from-treatment-effects-in-glioblastoma-a-practical-evidencegraded-imaging-framework-for-the-multidisciplinary-team-neurooncology</guid></item><item><title>新的大脑图谱连接小鼠和灵长类动物以加强医学研究</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/new-brain-map-connects-mice-and-primates-to-strengthen-medical-research</link><description>大多数神经科学研究仍然在小鼠身上进行，尽管许多适用于小鼠的研究并不适用于人类。狨猴已成为物种之间的桥梁。然而，比较小鼠和狨猴的大脑会遇到先有鸡还是先有蛋的问题。科学家需要知道一个大脑的哪个部分与另一个大脑的相应区域相匹配，但几乎每张大脑图都以不同的方式绘制这些区域。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-brain-map-connects-mice-and-primates-to-strengthen-medical-research.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 23:12:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/new-brain-map-connects-mice-and-primates-to-strengthen-medical-research</guid></item><item><title>肽MHC靶向工程病毒样颗粒可实现肿瘤特异性T细胞的选择性启动和基因编辑</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/peptidemhctargeted-engineered-viruslike-particles-enable-selective-priming-and-gene-editing-of-tumorspecific-t-cells</link><description>以及携带工程化 TCR55-A50E 的 T 细胞，该 TCR55-A50E 与 HIVpol/B 形成捕获键&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/peptidemhctargeted-engineered-viruslike-particles-enable-selective-priming-and-gene-editing-of-tumorspecific-t-cells.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 22:57:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/peptidemhctargeted-engineered-viruslike-particles-enable-selective-priming-and-gene-editing-of-tumorspecific-t-cells</guid></item><item><title>睡眠有助于在早期阶段识别出有患阿尔茨海默病风险的人</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/sleep-could-help-identify-people-at-risk-of-developing-alzheimers-disease-at-an-earlier-stage</link><description>如果早在第一次记忆问题出现之前，疾病的某些症状就在睡眠期间微妙地显现出来怎么办？这是列日大学的一组研究人员正在探索的研究方向。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/sleep-could-help-identify-people-at-risk-of-developing-alzheimers-disease-at-an-earlier-stage2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 22:42:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/sleep-could-help-identify-people-at-risk-of-developing-alzheimers-disease-at-an-earlier-stage</guid></item></channel></rss>